Method Behaviour <code>expectState(state)</code> Assert next state equals <code>state</code>. <code>expectState&lt;T&gt; { predicate }</code> Assert next state is an instance of <code>T</code> and matches the optional predicate. Access the typed state via <code>state</code>. <code>skipState()</code> Consume the next state without asserting. <pre><code>expectState(CounterState(count = 1))
expectState&lt;LoginState.Authenticated&gt; { state.username == "alice" }
</code></pre>
